	# Report a communication problem
	agent-incident.sh bridge_down "My bridge is not responding"
	```
	Messages are delivered via file-based mailbox at `/srv/dev/agents/_shared/mailbox/`.
	Each agent's bridge polls every 5 seconds and processes messages exactly once.

