## Telegram Server Management
```bash
tg-start           # Start Telegram bot server
tg-stop            # Stop the server
tg-restart         # Restart after code changes
tg-status          # Health check: PID, uptime, recent logs
tg-log             # Follow live operational logs
tg-inbox           # View pending messages
tg-inbox --all     # View all messages
tg-inbox --stats   # Message counts
tg-errors          # Follow error log
```

### Session Recall

```bash
mission-summary    # Summarize last mission (what was I working on?)
mission-summary -n 3  # Last 3 missions
mission-summary -a    # All missions
```

